{
  "description": "A mod made from scratch in the editor (the base has no entities, so the save has no blocks to follow: every entity is written whole): a weapon and an armor, a mount and a rider using them, an item with the weapon, a summoning spell for the rider, a site recruiting it, a nation recruiting it with the site, a band of them, an event making them; a vanilla unit changed (copy-on-write). Each must be one new entity with its values and references; undo all must give back the empty mod. A band's #com, #unit and #item are written as names (the game reads only a quoted name there: Dominions6.exe's merc parser), so the oracle shows the name, lowercased.",
  "base": "base_empty.dm",
  "edits": [
    { "op": "create", "entity": "weapon", "name": "Scratch Lance", "as": "w" },
